findings.remaining:
All of it. Neither packaging nor transmit has a deterministic preflight for any of these:
- PDF version (1.4–1.7, PDF/A-1/2);
- full font embedding;
- bookmarks/TOC on documents of 5+ pages;
- relative, resolvable hyperlinks;
- page size;
- text searchability;
- full relative path length.
The 'external' fallback adapter is opt-in and does not cover them. Whether the Ghostscript PDF/A-1b conversion in pdfa-pipeline.ts preserves links and bookmarks is still unverified.

